The mmltex.xsl stylesheet, which the MathML filter uses to do MathML->TeX conversion has some serious drawbacks.  It does not know the entity names for mathematical symbols.  Rather they all have to be pretranslated into the corresponding decimal character encodings.  Thus one needs to add a few hundred lines like the following to the filter to deal with this shortcoming. 
```text
$mathml = str_replace("&int;","&#8747;",$mathml);


$mathml = str_replace("&infin;","&#8734;",$mathml);


$mathml = str_replace("&emsp;","&#0032;",$mathml);
```

